      "snippet": {
        "text": "Artificial Intelligence(AI) strongly promotes the development of mathematical education.\n\nSince LLMs were put into use, (Wang et al., 2023b) simulated the process of human tutor, determining different strategy to address students' reasoning mistakes in mathematics.(Wu et al., 2023) studied mathematical education on conic sections in Chinese senior high school education using LLMs like GPT-4(OpenAI, 2023) and Chat-GLM (Du et al., 2022).(Long et al., 2023) evaluated ChatGPT on generating pre-university math questions, providing insights for teachers and researchers in utilizing LLMs in mathematical education.The research above reveals that making LLMs to be good teachers is a following trend for AI in mathematical education.",
