nd the compositions of geometric transformations. Each task only served as an initial problem for exploration and was further extended by the teacher-researchers during the subsequent class discussion to generalize the mathematical ideas developed by the students. Table 1 offers a brief description of the tasks developed and implemented during the teaching experiment. Whole group discussions surrounding the lessons served as data for the current study.",
