dia and syllabus; and learning tools, such as MCS tests and observation sheets (teachers and students activities). Before conducting experiments, the learning and research instruments were validated and tested. The data in this study were obtained from a test instrument (description test) to measure the students' MCSs before and after being the learning treatment.",
